SUMMARY:From Lawn to Woodland: How I Grew a Forest in my Own Backyard
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Todd Irvine\, cityforest.ca\, has been a certified arborist for 25 years. As the owner of City Forest\, he provides thoughtful tree pruning\, detailed yard consultations\, and one-on-one pruning workshops that empower homeowners to better understand and care for their trees.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/from-lawn-to-woodland-how-i-grew-a-forest-in-my-own-backyard/
LOCATION:Stan Wadlow Clubhouse\, 373 Cedarvale Ave.\, Toronto\, M4C 4K7
ORGANIZER;CN="East York Garden Club":MAILTO:gardenclub@eygc.ca
END:VEVENT
