SUMMARY:Toronto Walking Soccer Club -- Free Demo Day
DESCRIPTION:The Toronto Walking Soccer Club invites you to step onto the pitch at our Outdoor Season Opener & Demo Day. This FREE session is open to adults of all abilities\, no experience needed. Our ages range from 41-86\, skill levels from ex-pro to never kicked a ball before\, and knee health from a little creaky to fully replaced.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/toronto-walking-soccer-club-free-demo-day/
LOCATION:Cherry Beach Sports Fields\, 275 Unwin Avenue\, Toronto
END:VEVENT
