DESCRIPTION:Health: Active Aging. Explore how adults can thrive physically\, mentally and socially into later life. Speakers to be confirmed.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/ymca-spring-talks-3/
LOCATION:The Steve & Sally Stavro Family YMCA\, 907 Kingston Rd\, Toronto\, M4E 1S4
END:VEVENT
