SUMMARY:Cantemus Singers
DESCRIPTION:Cantemus Singers\, conducted by Michael Erdman\, present “Good Queen Bess”\, a concert of Elizabethan music for Easter and Springtime featuring works by Tallis\, Byrd\, Morley and Tomkins. A performance will also be held at Church of the Holy Trinity\, Eaton Centre\, on Sunday April 26 at 3 p.m. Tickets at the door (cash)\, or via Eventbrite at www.cantemus.ca. General Admission $35 / Kids under 12 free. Info/reservations: 416-578-6602
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/cantemus-singers/
LOCATION:St. Aidan’s Anglican Church\, 2423 Queen St. E.\, Toronto\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/18113650/Cantemus-Singers-Ad-fixed.jpg
