SUMMARY:Everyone Has A Story To Tell
DESCRIPTION:Everyone Has A Story To Tell\, an invitation to a small writing workshop. Enjoy a coffee and write some memories with writer Patricia Brean. Enrollment is free. Please email pat_brean@hotmail.com to sign up.
